      "runbook_id": "RB-ECC",
      "path": "data/runbooks/memory_ecc.md",
      "text": "# Memory and ECC triage\n\nRunbook ID: `RB-ECC`\n\nUse when corrected or uncorrected memory errors are explicitly recorded.\n\n1. Distinguish corrected from uncorrected errors.\n2. Aggregate events by location only when a stable location is present.\n3. Check recurrence and proximity to resets or thermal events.\n4. Preserve syndrome/location fields without inventing missing values.\n5. Escalate uncorrected errors; monitor isolated corrected events according to\n   platform policy.\n\n",
