      "runbook_id": "RB-UNKNOWN",
      "path": "data/runbooks/unknown_mixed.md",
      "text": "# Unknown or mixed evidence\n\nRunbook ID: `RB-UNKNOWN`\n\nUse when evidence is contradictory, incomplete, or spans multiple subsystems\nwithout a supported primary cause.\n\n1. Summarize only directly observed symptoms.\n2. Cite every material statement to a log line.\n3. State which information is missing.\n4. Recommend bounded data collection rather than a speculative repair.\n5. Abstain from root-cause claims.\n\n",
